# Default owner for everything in this repo.
# Enforced via the main-protection ruleset (require_code_owner_review).
#
# §10b — review here is a PRODUCTION ACCESS CONTROL, not a code-quality
# convention: "whoever can push to `gitops` can deploy anything, because ArgoCD
# will faithfully apply it."
#
# `platform-infra` rather than a product team: this repository deploys EVERY
# product, so no single product's maintainers should own it.
* @quynhonsemiconductor/platform-infra

# ── The two paths where review matters most ─────────────────────────────────
# A chart change reaches every Application at once (§11c), and a prod tag bump IS
# the promotion (§11). Both are covered by the wildcard above; they are listed so
# the reason is visible to whoever is reviewing.
/charts/                  @quynhonsemiconductor/platform-infra
/values/*/tags.prod.yaml  @quynhonsemiconductor/platform-infra
